  "sourceReview": "The first fixture could mistake its forced lifetime exit for cooperative cleanup. The revised controls require a fixed cleanup byte followed by EOF, successful role Wait outcomes and an independently bound host exit-status watch reporting zero. All observations and joins share one two-second cleanup deadline with margin before the fifteen-second family lifetime. Missing receipts, nonzero/absent host status and uncertain watches fail closed. These controls do not alter the stable public fixture-helper API.",
